);\n        assertThat(restored.values()).containsExactlyInAnyOrder(\"first\", \"second\");\n        assertThat(restored.keySet()).allMatch(\"key\"::equals);\n    }\n\n    private static <K, V> NonBlockingIdentityHashMap<K, V> roundTrip(NonBlockingIdentityHashMap<K, V> map)\n            throws IOException, ClassNotFoundException {\n        ByteArrayOutputStream bytes = new ByteArrayOutputStream();\n        try (ObjectOutputStream output = new ObjectOutputStream(bytes)) {\n            output.writeObject(map);\n        }\n\n        try (ObjectInputStream input = new ObjectInputStream(new ByteArrayInputStream(bytes.toByteArray()))) {\n            @SuppressWarnings(\"unchecked\")\n            NonBlockingIdentityHashMap<K, V> restored = (NonBlockingIdentityHashMap<K, V>) input.readObject();\n            return restored;\n        }\n    }\n}\n"}}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 4443, "output": 893, "cacheRead": 31232, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 375, "totalTokens": 36568, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1786818064349, "responseId": "resp_02a1a188e816563d016a80ae1073148191bc9661b985aee5a5", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": [{"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_lmnDFir5TiItoccxNdZ9Ynae|fc_02a1a188e816563d016a80ae21abe0819192c3eeadd7770068", "toolName": "write", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Successfully wrote 1861 bytes to tests/src/org.jctools/jctools-core/4.0.3/src/test/java/org_jctools/jctools_core/NonBlockingIdentityHashMapTest.java"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1786818087891}]}
